WEBVTT

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.990
Okay, we're going to
translate these sentences.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.270
Okay.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.520
I am glad.
So wonderfully glad.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.610
How my heart
dances with joy.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.830
I-am-glad.
So-wonderfully-glad.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.620
How-my-heart-
dances-with-joy.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:59.950
The joy is welling up within me,
and my heart is about to burst.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:02.790
The reason being,
today is...

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.020
What?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.070
The-reason-being,
today-is...

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:08.860
...the day I get paid!!

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.900
The reason being, today is...
What?

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:17.870
What comes next?

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.130
Gee, you're weird.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.510
The reason being,
today is my birthday.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:32.720
Break time.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.240
Thank you.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.800
See ya later,
Big Brother.

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:50.660
We'll look forward to
seeing you next week.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.890
Yup, next week.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.990
Thank you so much.
Until next time.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:02:59.760
Yeah, until next time.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.570
Oh, no.
She's Forgotten!

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.120
Oh, that's right!

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.200
Here you go.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:19.370
Kyoko left this on her last visit.
Please return it for me.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:37.760
I--

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.160
Hi, there!
Okame Sushi delivery!

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:41.670
How much?

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.640
It'll be 4300 yen.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:45.620
That'll remind her!

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:48.740
Here, 4300.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:50.450
Oh, Godai...

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.330
Is anything wrong?

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:56.650
--Nothing. Good night.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.080
Just as my plans
were working out--

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.730
Big Brother!

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.200
Here's your pay!
Mom forgot!

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.590
Big Brother!
Here's your pay!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.920
Big Brother!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.120
M-My pay!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.700
All right!

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:06.890
How time flies.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.560
It's already been a year
since I came to Maison Ikkoku.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:14.990
So much has happened.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.970
But the only thing that's changed
is that Godai is in college now.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.930
He's still the
same Godai, though.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:38.530
Calm down.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:41.880
Nonchalance. Nonchalance.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.930
No chalance at all!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:51.520
Okay.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:03.810
It's just us.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.610
Okay. This is it.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.640
I-Is she sleeping?

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.100
No!!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.110
That's not what
I'm here For!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.300
When did I--?

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.530
I didn't do a thing.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.310
I know that.
I was awake the whole time.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:08.800
That was close.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.510
I hope he didn't
see anything...

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.850
Can I help you?

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.370
Y-Yeah--

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:28.410
Is there something--?

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.960
A-Ar--

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.430
Are you free
this evening?

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:37.690
Yes--?

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:40.840
W-Would you
have dinner with me?

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:43.910
I just got paid--

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:44.700
Yes.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.940
I can't treat you to
anything too fancy, but--

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.480
Of course, I'll be paying.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.430
Yes.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.010
So--

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:58.440
Yes?

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:00.760
T-That's okay with you?

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:03.390
Yes!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.760
Then we'll meet at six.
Over at Ma Maison.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.450
You know it, don't you?

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:13.400
Yes.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.670
Then, six o'clock at Ma Maison.

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:21.810
MA MAISON

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.890
Yes! Six o'clock at Mamezo.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.510
MAMEZO

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.260
I did it!  I did it!
I did it!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.550
I can still hear you.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.810
He remembered
the one-year anniversary.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.540
On-a-date-with-Kyoko!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.360
What am I gonna wear?

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.000
I was just
lookin' for you.

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:47.460
I refuse.

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.700
I haven't asked
you anything yet.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.240
Let me guess. We're
drinking tonight. Big party.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.120
That's scary. You hit
the nail on the head.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.550
Forgive me. I've made
other arrangements.

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.790
But tonight's--

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.330
I said no
and I mean 'no!

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.800
It's a party for the
manager's anniversary.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.560
What a cold fish he is.

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.410
...so we're holding a party.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:26.740
I-- see.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:30.290
I see? Is tonight
a bad night?

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.090
Well, I've
made other plans.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.960
But you're the guest of honor.
Show up for a little while.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.590
It's at six, at Mamezo.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:46.030
Mamezo? I'm supposed to be
meeting him at Mamezo, at six.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.410
Meeting WHO?

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.410
It doesn't matter.
I'll find out at six anyway.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.600
You're throwing a party?

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:01.620
Good ears. You're more than
a set of sparkling teeth.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.400
How you jest.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:08.510
We're having a First-Anniversary-
as-Manager Party, tonight.

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:10.620
You coming?

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:14.640
I'd like to. But I'm not a tenant.
I'd be intruding.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.260
Don't wanna come?

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.210
I'll be there.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.980
BYOB. Don't forget your wallet.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.130
Meeting at
the same place--

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:34.700
Why couldn't Godai pick
a more appropriate place?

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.450
It doesn't matter.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.940
What am I going to wear?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.790
MA MAISON

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.210
I'm a little early,
but I may as well go in.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:11.420
MAMEZO
Let's get this party rolling.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:16.510
This is it.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:18.960
Welcome!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.390
There she is!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.720
Took you long enough.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:24.830
Sorry--

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.020
Take the seat of honor.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.660
You're late, so you gotta
chug the first one down.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:38.010
But I have
another engagement--

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:43.760
You've been stood up.
It's after six already.

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:45.270
But--

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:49.700
Speaking of which,
Godai's not here.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:53.680
So the party doesn't
include all the tenants?

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.930
Y'see. He just got
himself a new girlfriend.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.910
A secret rendezvous, is it?

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:04.530
Twenty minutes late?

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.180
Happens all the time
with women.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.480
Just have to make
allowances, and wait.

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:28.990
I am a pachinko genius!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.330
I know her.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.150
Godais girlfriend?

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.870
I'll wait till seven
and if she isn't here...

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.450
...then I'll wait till eight.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:11.940
C'mon in!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.290
So who are you
waitin' for, anyway?

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.250
Confession is
good for the soul.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.340
Geez, it's already seven!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.920
You've been dumped.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.800
Whatta bum...

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:26.910
...standin' you up like that.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.210
How dare Godai!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.290
--Godai!?
--Godai!?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.250
T-That's right.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.230
He wants to meet
you in a bar?

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.680
Yeah, but---

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.330
You sure he didn't
mean Ma Maison?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.700
That coffee shop
by the station.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.050
It would be confusing:
Ma Maison and Mamezo.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.260
Ma Maison.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.270
Mamezo.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:55.880
I have to leave.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.650
It's after seven.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.560
I'm sure he's left already--

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.570
--I'll go along!
--Thank you!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.350
I'm not lettin' you go.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.210
Uh, excuse me--?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.060
He's been here more
than an hour already.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.600
Wonder if he's
been dumped--?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.330
He's shaking.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.060
He's angry!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:28.240
I've tried to hold out.
I've tried!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.320
But even I have...

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.930
...my limits!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.650
Welcome.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.160
Yo, Godai, what's shakin'?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.940
Look at that get-up!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.260
Got a date, huh?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.950
If you do,
whatcha doin' here?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.030
She's in that coffee shop
near the pachinko parlor.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:30.710
Kyoko must have gotten the
wrong place. That must be it!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.920
What's with him?

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.140
Aren't you Godais
apartment manager?

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:49.190
Aren't you
Godais friend--?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.520
Sakamoto.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.280
Right; Sakamoto.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.600
You haven't
seen Godai lately?

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:56.530
Yup.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.860
Y'see. It looks like
Godais got a date.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.720
Let's see. I think
her name was Kozue--

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:07.570
With Kozue?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.720
Yeah. One mention of her
and he blew outta here.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.350
If they got married,
he'd be henpecked for sure!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.260
Out with Kozue?
He's on a date with Kozue!?

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.180
I'm a Few minutes late, and
he's out with someone else!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.890
Sakamoto?
How would you like a drink?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:34.530
Kyoko!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:37.600
Kyoko!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:40.540
Kyoko!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.680
Where are you!?

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.760
Kyoko!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.840
We need a new bar!

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.090
One more bar!
One more bar!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:55.180
You win.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.650
I am never talking
to Godai' again!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.130
C'mon in!!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.140
There are four of us.
You got space?

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.280
This place's cheap!
And great fried rice balls.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.440
I'll have that!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:14.800
Those seats in back--

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.820
Never been here before.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.540
A-Aren't you Kozue?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.310
Yes.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.980
Weren't you supposed
to be with Godai?

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.750
No. Haven't seen him.

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.260
S-Sakamoto
didn't you say!?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.130
He's down for the count.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:41.510
Then that means--

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.080
Where could
she have gone?

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:54.340
Kyoko!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.740
Godai'
You wouldn't! still--?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.430
But, you might still be--

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:25.840
Kyoko...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.970
Isn't that customer
a little strange?

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:33.960
Godai!

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:38.570
'Scuse me!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.400
We're closing up.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:51.880
Have you--?

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.110
Nothing.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.540
Here, dry yourself off.

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.580
Thank you so much.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:08.950
M-Manager?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:26.070
Those're the clothes she wore
a year ago. When we first met.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:32.380
Godai. You've been waiting
all this time. Waiting for me.

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:36.140
Manager!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.200
I'm so sorry--

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:39.810
Manager!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.600
I'm sorry.
I'm so sorry--

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:44.030
Don't cry.
I'm not angry.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.470
B-But, three hours--!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.830
I mean--
It's nothing, really!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.320
Manager!

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.670
Won't you move a
little closer in?

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:33.700
I did it!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.850
Yeah, seize the moment, and
casually put your arm around her.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.240
I'd better let him get away with it.
I WAS three hours late.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.780
So you were
waiting at Mamezo.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.620
I don't know how
to apologize.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:58.830
I could never create this mood!
Probably my best chance all year!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:04.090
Now to make this last
as long as possible!

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:04.990
Yo!

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.400
Hello, you two.
You forgot this.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:08.620
Thank you.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:13.120
You had us worried
stormin' outta the bar like! that--

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:16.030
Our worries were
unfounded, it seems.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.170
Godai, the manager is soaking.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.820
--Here.
--T-Thank you.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:25.190
--Your permission to share?
--I want some umbrella, too!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:35.110
Oh dear.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:39.350
Good night!

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:40.350
Sleep tight!

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:42.010
'Night-night.

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.390
Until tomorrow, then.

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:50.650
Godai, I-I'm really
sorry about tonight.

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:51.810
Don't mention it.

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:54.520
Look, you're getting drenched.
Come under the umbrella--

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.370
Wait up.
Wait up, please!

00:22:58.190 --> 00:22:58.950
Godai!

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:04.480
It's all right.
I'm not angry.

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:08.530
Really?

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:11.460
Really.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.220
Nonchalance...

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:19.790
You're trying to take
advantage of me! You creep!

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.210
She doesn't get caught
up in the mood, does she?

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:35.000
I can't watch!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.640
--So close!
--Too bad.

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:42.580
I don't ever wanna
be like that. Y'know?

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:53.500
I hear Godai is going to be
a puppeteer in the school festival.

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:56.030
Of course, everyone
wants to get into the act.

00:23:56.510 --> 00:24:00.110
Next: The Play's the Thing,
Not the Playing Around!
The Show Must Go On

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:03.020
I couldn't! I could
never be a puppeteer!

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:06.860
Eeek! Save me, my prince!
